      "geometry_copy_allowed": false,
      "dimensional_measurement_allowed": false,
      "observations": [
        "Seven articulated axes provide redundancy in a compact work cell.",
        "Continuous light link shells and dark joint collars make the kinematic chain legible.",
        "Structural joints can be internal while removable collars conceal service interfaces.",
        "The generated robot must use independent dimensions and distinct surface geometry."
      ],
      "observed_date": "2026-08-24",
