    {
      "id": "factor-of-safety-uncertainty-lesson",
      "media_kind": "external_page",
      "locator": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcTj4PEzaiq/",
      "creator": "sarang.tech",
      "rights_basis": "publicly_viewable_inspiration_only_no_copying",
      "use": "engineering_uncertainty_budget_method_only",
      "geometry_copy_allowed": false,
      "dimensional_measurement_allowed": false,
      "observations": [
        "A safety factor is an explicit budget for imperfect knowledge, not an unexplained constant.",
        "Material scatter, manufacturing variation, uncertain loads, model error and consequence must be separated.",
        "Better evidence can reduce an individual uncertainty contribution but may not silently erase the others."
      ],
      "observed_date": "2026-08-24",
      "source_fingerprint_sha256": "393d0f29b39d17c3f8c5a04871bf80a1ee3fd950ea44c2e2470c605e307d3979"
    },
    {
      "id": "stateful-graph-engineering-lesson",
      "media_kind": "external_page",
      "locator": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Db9_oRNucnQ/",
      "creator": "techwithnt",
      "rights_basis": "publicly_viewable_inspiration_only_no_copying",
      "use": "stateful_engineering_workflow_method_only",
      "geometry_copy_allowed": false,
      "dimensional_measurement_allowed": false,
      "observations": [
        "A graph defines nodes that perform work, edges that control transitions and typed state shared between steps.",
        "Engineering paths need to branch by domain, merge for interface review and loop back for targeted repair.",
        "AI variability must be bounded by deterministic state transitions and software-owned validation conditions."
      ],
      "observed_date": "2026-08-24",
      "source_fingerprint_sha256": "a337981d901d91eedf9ee8647980461eeb37c055a2f0b53fd3e3b03432c050a8"
